al\\\\Google\\\\Chrome\\\\User Data\\\\DevToolsActivePort`.\\n2. Check that the remote debugging port is open.\\n3. Verify if there are multiple processes listening for the port; if so, kill these processes.\\n4. Ensure Google Chrome is running with remote debugging enabled, or navigate to `chrome://inspect/#remote-debugging` in Chrome and verify the settings.\\n\\nOnce Chrome is running with remote debugging enabled, please re-invoke this task to proceed with testing the GHG platform.\\n\\nNote: The recording of this session is available in the conversation artifacts.\",\"Recipient\":\"9d34f1cc-2595-4c4a-962f-f853c3e22d4e\",\"toolAction\":\"Reporting Chrome connection error\",\"toolSummary\":\"Report connection error to parent\"}","thinkingSignature":""}}}}